Q6. TOTAL COST WITH DISCOUNT AND TAX
------------------------------------
prices = [100, 200, 150]
quantities = [2, 1, 3]
discount_rate = 10
tax_rate = 5

subtotal = sum(p*q for p, q in zip(prices, quantities))
discount = subtotal * discount_rate / 100
tax = (subtotal - discount) * tax_rate / 100
print("Total cost:", subtotal - discount + tax)

